# AI Use Pitfalls

#### Understanding how AI works can help keep yourself and your students from falling to common pitfalls.

#### Review the scenarios on the following levels to explore various pitfalls, to learn more about why each occured, and to learn how to avoid them in the future.

>#### **💬 Quick Reflection:** What pitfalls have you fallen into when using AI? What pitfalls have you seen your colleagues or students fall into?
>#### Keep an eye out for these pitfalls as you're reviewing the following scenarios.

